# Semgrep ignore list. NOTE: a project .semgrepignore replaces Semgrep's built-in
# default, so the common defaults are re-listed here alongside our own excludes.

# --- Our excludes: vendored / third-party code (mirrors ruff + pre-commit) ---
# Owned by upstream repos (OCA modules, static libs); not ours to lint.
addons/_vendor/
**/static/lib/
*.min.js
*.min.css

# --- Re-listed Semgrep defaults ---
.git/
node_modules/
vendor/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
build/
